    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the ever-shifting halls of a haunted psychiatric hospital\u2014where every playthrough reshapes itself around you. In this first-person roguelike shooter, you\u2019ll blast your way through demons, zombies, and other unholy abominations as you fight your way up through increasingly hostile floors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every danger you face comes from the relentless hordes themselves and the dark atmosphere. Each run offers fresh layouts, new gear, and the chance to climb higher than before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomly Generated Asylum</strong> Every floor is built anew each run\u2014twisted corridors, blood-spattered cells, and shadowed treatment rooms emerge in random configurations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced FPS Combat</strong> Wield shotguns, pistols, and experimental firearms against demons, zombies, and other nightmarish foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror</strong> Eerie sound design, flickering lights, and chilling set pieces immerse you in a fight for survival against the supernatural.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a relentless ascent through madness\u2014gear up, manage your resources wisely, and see how far you can climb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the ever-shifting halls of a haunted psychiatric hospital\u2014where every playthrough reshapes itself around you. In this first-person roguelike shooter, you\u2019ll blast your way through demons, zombies, and other unholy abominations as you fight your way up through increasingly hostile floors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every danger you face comes from the relentless hordes themselves and the dark atmosphere. Each run offers fresh layouts, new gear, and the chance to climb higher than before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomly Generated Asylum</strong> Every floor is built anew each run\u2014twisted corridors, blood-spattered cells, and shadowed treatment rooms emerge in random configurations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced FPS Combat</strong> Wield shotguns, pistols, and experimental firearms against demons, zombies, and other nightmarish foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror</strong> Eerie sound design, flickering lights, and chilling set pieces immerse you in a fight for survival against the supernatural.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a relentless ascent through madness\u2014gear up, manage your resources wisely, and see how far you can climb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
